OL,3,GNEWSATakeaway owner 'shaken' by egg and
OL,4,Astone attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people throwing eggs and stones
OL,7,Fin repeated attacks on a Chinese
OL,8,Ftakeaway has left its owner "shaken".
OL,10,FVivian, owner of Dragon House on
OL,11,FFoxwood Lane in York, posted images on
OL,12,FFacebook showing the aftermath of the
OL,13,Fattacks, including a carton of broken
OL,14,Feggs discarded on the ground and the
OL,15,Ftakeaway's smeared windows.
OL,17,FIn her message, Vivian said: "I just
OL,18,Fwant to open the shop tomorrow and feel
OL,19,Fsafe doing the job I love. It's a
OL,20,Fhorrible feeling to stand behind your
OL,21,Fown counter and wonder if it's going to
OL,22,Fhappen again."
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
