OL,3,GNEWSATakeaway owner 'shaken' by egg and
OL,4,Astone attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Yorkshire Police said it was
OL,7,Finvestigating reports of eggs being
OL,8,Fthrown at the takeaway, adding that a
OL,9,Fnumber of incidents had been reported
OL,10,Fin the area.
